Probably a different situation than the OP, but I also autopickup gems
in my speed runs and conduct games. Later, at a shop, the unidentified
price quote leaks enough information to sort out the glass. For speed
runs, that means I already have a some real gems when I get the wand
of wishing, and the chance there aren't enough in the castle stores
for the reverse-genocided unicorns is lower. For heavy conduct games,
carrying enough inofficially-identified real gems to maximize Luck
means I stand a better chance I don't have to protect the first co-
aligned unicorn from my pets.

